{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は世界気象デー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気象の共同観測や資料交換などの\n国際協力を目的に制定された日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"国際協力のためにって素敵だね☺︎\n世界平和☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/23/7716044/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/23/7716044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日誕生日を迎えた川後と\n舞台稽古を頑張ってる愛未。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しだよ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/23/7716044/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜が咲く季節！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この季節を一年間ずっと待ち遠しくしてるから\nとっても嬉しいんだ〜(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこの桜はまだ満開じゃないね。\nその感じも好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/23/7716044/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥と青空のコラボ。\nこの雰囲気が好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの鳥の下、フン注意！\nって書かれてたから\nドキドキしながら撮ってたんだけど\n大丈夫で良かった〜(｡･o･｡)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はピンクっぽい写真と\n青っぽい写真で雰囲気が違うから\n良い感じがする〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一眼レフ欲しいな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「風船は生きている」乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲のMVが好き！\n今までで一番好きかも。\nスーツにメガネっていう\n斬新な格好に、裁判官っていう設定。\nそして怒る演技や投げる演技や、\n今までと違う部分が多かった！\n\"いつも 肩肘を張ってないで\nもっと 楽に息を吐いたら\nやさしさに溢れるよ\"\n二番のこの歌詞が好き。\nやさしさに溢れるってところが。\n是非MVみてほしいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/23/7716044/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/23/7716044/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また完売が増えて嬉しいヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に皆さんありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして4/9の握手会の締め切りが\n明日までらしい...！(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方に会えますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}